# Leatherhead, Swamp Stalker enters with a hexproof counter and tramples. On turn 3 she connects with Bot2, a 5/4 dealing 5,
# and Bot1 accepts removing a counter from her: the reflexive trigger then destroys the Sol Ring Bot2 controls, and with the
# hexproof counter gone she has none left.

